[0.008, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mA failur\u001b[12G I haven't diagnosed:\u001b[22m Ada's \u001b[41Ghip once spent the pad's full 300\u001b[75Gs res\u001b[81Grvation arriving\u001b[98Gat Ore, then\u001b[111Gfailed\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bwi\u001b[6Gh \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mPadLost\u001b[39m. Eve\u001b[21Gy other a\u001b[31Grival\u001b[37Gtakes about 70 s. Th\u001b[58G t\u001b[61Gading job\u001b[71Ghandled it correctly (bl\u001b[96Gcked, retried\u001b[110Gat th\u001b[117Gnext\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bminut\u001b[9G,\u001b[11Gflew\u001b[16Gagain), and it happens\u001b[39Gthe s\u001b[45Gme\u001b[48Gway\u001b[52Gevery\u001b[58Grun. It's\u001b[68Grecorded in the\u001b[84Gplan's \"Left\" l\u001b[101Gt, \u001b[105Got\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Binve\u001b[8Gtigated.\u001b[17GI\u001b[19G's\u001b[22Gprobably th\u001b[34G same \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mPadLost\u001b[39m we\u001b[51Gsaw in slice 3.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[1mCost:\u001b[22m under ASan the \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfixture\u001b[39m suite now takes 127 s and is the slowest suite. In the debug build it takes 23\u001b[111Gs.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mNext is L28:\u001b[16G\u001b[22mstopping docked ships from\u001b[43Gforcing every step to run. That mea\u001b[79Gs changi\u001b[88Gg when observation needs\u001b[113Gto\u001b[116Grun\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Ba\u001b[5Gd keeping skipped steps exact\u001b[35Gto the bit. I'd\u001b[51Gkeep Opus at\u001b[64Ghigh\u001b[69Geffort\u001b[76Gfor\u001b[80Git,\u001b[84Gsince\u001b[90Ga\u001b[92Gcheaper\u001b[100Gmodel\u001b[106Gis\u001b[109Glikely\u001b[116Gto\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bget\u001b[7Gthe\u001b[11Greports'\u001b[20Gexactness\u001b[30Gsubtly\u001b[37Gwrong.\u001b[44GThe\u001b[48G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mPadLost\u001b[56G\u001b[39marrival\u001b[64Gmay\u001b[68Gbe\u001b[71Gworth\u001b[77Ga\u001b[79Glook\u001b[84Gfirst,\u001b[91Gor\u001b[94Galongside\u001b[104Git.\u001b[108GThis\u001b[113Gis\u001b[116Ga\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bgood point to \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/compact\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2BI didn't run\u001b[16Gthe new test through a \u001b[40Geal \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mRemote::Server\u001b[39m; it steps the session\u001b[81Gdirectly, as the server's\u001b[107Gloop does.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GBrewed for 11m 17s · done 3:46 pm\u001b[37G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m/compact\u001b[39m                                                                                                              \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;147;165;255m✢\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;177;195;255mCo\u001b[38;2;147;165;255mmpacting conversation… \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(0s)\u001b[33G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿\u001b[5G Tip: Connect\u001b[19GClaude\u001b[26Gto\u001b[29Gyour IDE · /ide\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[38C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
