;153;153;153m  ⎿  Found \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m new diagnostic issue in 1 file (ctrl+o to expand)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m Ship2 isn't failing on the cruise: it circles about 50 m above its pad at roughly 40 m/s and never slows enough to\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcount as arrived, while Ship1 handled the same approach fine. I'm\u001b[69Glogging\u001b[77Gits\u001b[81Gposition\u001b[90Gin\u001b[93Gthe\u001b[97Gpad's\u001b[103Gframe\u001b[109Gnext\u001b[114Gto\u001b[117Gsee\r\u001b[1B  what holds it off.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · \u001b[25Gummary\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✶\u001b[3GSchlepping… \u001b[40G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mthought for 18s)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
