[0.081, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H  \u001b[1mYour question about frames:\u001b[31G\u001b[22myes.\u001b[36GWhile\u001b[42Gapproaching,\u001b[55Gthe\u001b[59Gship\u001b[64Gis\u001b[67Gin\u001b[70Gthe\u001b[74Gsame\u001b[79Gphysics\u001b[87Gframe\u001b[93Gas\u001b[96Gthe\u001b[100Gstation:\u001b[109Gthe\u001b[113Gframe\u001b[119Gof\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe body the station orbits\u001b[31Gon\u001b[34Grails.\u001b[41GThe\u001b[45Gship\u001b[50Gis\u001b[53Gmoved\u001b[59Ginto\u001b[64Git\u001b[67Gwhen\u001b[72Gits\u001b[76Gcruise\u001b[83Gends\u001b[88G(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mCruise.cpp:599\u001b[39m),\u001b[106Gand\u001b[110Gthe\u001b[114Gdocks\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bgive up\u001b[11Gany pad whose ship\u001b[30Gis\u001b[33Gin\u001b[36Ga\u001b[38Gdifferent\u001b[48Gframe.\u001b[55GThe\u001b[59Gstation\u001b[67Gdoesn't\u001b[75Gspin\u001b[80G(its\u001b[85Gangular\u001b[93Gvelocity\u001b[102Gis\u001b[105G0).\u001b[109GIn\u001b[112Gsystem\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcoordinates everything\u001b[26Gmoves\u001b[32Gat\u001b[35Gabout\u001b[41G33\u001b[44Gkm/s,\u001b[50Gbut\u001b[54Gthat\u001b[59Gis\u001b[62Gthe\u001b[66Gbody's\u001b[73Gown\u001b[77Gorbit;\u001b[84Ginside\u001b[91Gthe\u001b[95Gframe\u001b[101Gthe\u001b[105Gship's\u001b[112Gspeeds\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bare tens of metres a second. So the frames are consistent.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat goes wrong:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GThe docks fly an inbound\u001b[30Gship\u001b[35Gto\u001b[38Ga\u001b[40Gpoint\u001b[46Gabove\u001b[52Gits\u001b[56Gpad.\u001b[61GThat\u001b[66Gpoint\u001b[72Gis\u001b[75Gonly\u001b[80G10\u001b[83Gm\u001b[85Goutside\u001b[93Gthe\u001b[97Gzone\u001b[102Gsteering\u001b[111Gkeeps\u001b[117Gthe\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bship\u001b[10Gaway\u001b[15Gfrom\u001b[20Garound\u001b[27Gthe\u001b[31Gstation\u001b[39G(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mkAboveMargin = 10.0\u001b[60G\u001b[39min\u001b[63G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mDocks.cpp\u001b[39m).\u001b[75GThe\u001b[79Gship\u001b[84Gonly\u001b[89Ghas\u001b[93Gto\u001b[96Gget\u001b[100Gwithin\u001b[107G20\u001b[110Gm\u001b[112Gof\u001b[115Gthe\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bpoint to\u001b[14Garrive, so the arrival zone already reaches into the keep-away zone.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GShip2 reached Ore on the far side, so it was routed around the station\u001b[76Gthrough\u001b[84Ga\u001b[86Gwaypoint.\u001b[96GIt\u001b[99Gcame\u001b[104Goff\u001b[108Gthe\u001b[112Gwaypoint\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bat about\u001b[14G100\u001b[18Gm/s,\u001b[23Gmoving\u001b[30Gsideways\u001b[39Gto\u001b[42Gthe\u001b[46Gtarget,\u001b[54Gand\u001b[58Govershot\u001b[67Gby\u001b[70Gabout\u001b[76G50\u001b[79Gm\u001b[81Ginto\u001b[86Gthe\u001b[90Gkeep-away\u001b[100Gzone.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GInside that zone, avoidance commands up to about 190 m/s outward while arrival pulls the ship back in. That puts\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Benergy back in every lap: the ship circled 30–55 m from the point at about 40 m/s for the pad's full 300 s, never\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Barrived,\u001b[14Gand\u001b[18Gthe\u001b[22Gpad\u001b[26Glapsed.\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G- Sh\u001b[8Gp1\u001b[11Gcame in\u001b[19Gthrough a\u001b[29Gwaypoint\u001b[38Gtoo\u001b[42Gand\u001b[46Garrived;\u001b[55Gits\u001b[59Ggeometry\u001b[68Ghappened\u001b[77Gnot\u001b[81Gto\u001b[84Govershoot.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  \u001b[1mWhat I checked:\u001b[22m I temporarily raised the margin to 100 m in the\u001b[67Gfetched\u001b[75Gengine\u001b[82Gcopy\u001b[87Gand\u001b[91Greran.\u001b[98GShip2\u001b[104Gstill\u001b[110Govershot,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bto\u001b[6Gabout\u001b[12G180\u001b[16Gm,\u001b[19Gbut\u001b[23Gswung\u001b[29Gback\u001b[34Gand\u001b[38Garrived\u001b[46G62\u001b[49Gs\u001b[51Gafter\u001b[57Gthe\u001b[61Gcruise\u001b[68Gended,\u001b[75Gabout\u001b[81Gas\u001b[84Glong\u001b[89Gas\u001b[92Gother\u001b[98Garrivals\u001b[107Gtake,\u001b[113Gand\u001b[117Gno\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gpad lapsed in the 25 minutes. Both edits and the experiment\u001b[63Gtest\u001b[68Gare\u001b[72Greverted.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[0.138, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3Gthe body the station orbits\u001b[31Gon rails. The ship \u001b[51Gs moved\u001b[59Ginto\u001b[65Gt\u001b[67Gwhen it\u001b[75G cruise ends (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mCruise.cpp:599\u001b[39m), and the docks\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bgive up any pad wh\u001b[22Gse sh\u001b[28Gp is in a different frame. The\u001b[59Gstation\u001b[67Gdo\u001b[70Gsn'\u001b[74G spin (its angular velocity is 0). In system\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcoordinates\u001b[15Geverything moves at about 33 km/s, but that\u001b[59Gis \u001b[63Ghe body's own orbit; inside the frame the\u001b[105Gship's\u001b[113Gpeeds\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bare te\u001b[10Gs of\u001b[15Gmet\u001b[19Ges a sec\u001b[28Gnd.\u001b[32GSo\u001b[35Gthe frames are\u001b[50Gconsistent.\u001b[62G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat goes wrong:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- The docks fly an\u001b[22Ginbound\u001b[30Gship\u001b[35Gto\u001b[38Ga\u001b[40Gpoint\u001b[46Gabove\u001b[52Gits\u001b[56Gpad.\u001b[61GThat\u001b[66Gpoint\u001b[72Gis\u001b[75Gonly\u001b[80G10\u001b[83Gm\u001b[85Goutside\u001b[93Gthe\u001b[97Gzone\u001b[102Gsteering\u001b[111Gkeeps\u001b[117Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gs\u001b[7Gip away\u001b[16Grom around the stati\u001b[37Gn (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mkAboveMargin = 10.0\u001b[39m in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mDocks.cpp\u001b[39m).\u001b[75GThe ship only has\u001b[94Go get within 20 m of the\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bpo\u001b[8Gnt to ar\u001b[17Give, so the arrival zone already reaches into\u001b[63Gthe keep-away zone.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GSh\u001b[8Gp2\u001b[11Greached Ore \u001b[24Gn the far side, so it was\u001b[51Gouted around the station through\u001b[84Ga\u001b[86Gwaypoint.\u001b[96GIt\u001b[99Gcame\u001b[104Goff\u001b[108Gthe\u001b[112Gwaypoint\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gat about 100 m/s,\u001b[23Gmoving\u001b[30Gsideways to the\u001b[46Gt\u001b[48Grget, and overshot by \u001b[71Gbout\u001b[76G50 m into\u001b[86Gthe keep-away zone.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GInside \u001b[13Ghat zone\u001b[23Gavo\u001b[27Gdance commands\u001b[42Gup to about\u001b[54G190\u001b[58Gm/s outward\u001b[70Gwhile\u001b[76Garrival pulls\u001b[90Gth\u001b[93G ship back in.\u001b[108GThat\u001b[113Gputs\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Ge\u001b[7Gergy\u001b[12Gback\u001b[17Gin \u001b[21Gvery lap: the ship circled\u001b[48G30–55\u001b[54Gm from the point at about 40 m/s for the pad's full 300 s,\u001b[113Gnever\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Barrived, and th\u001b[21G pad\u001b[29Gsed.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GShip1 came in through \u001b[28G waypoint\u001b[38Gtoo\u001b[42Gand\u001b[46Garrived;\u001b[55Gits\u001b[59Ggeometry\u001b[68Ghappened\u001b[77Gnot\u001b[81Gto\u001b[84Govershoot.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat I checked:\u001b[19G\u001b[22mI\u001b[21Gtemporarily\u001b[33Graised\u001b[40Gthe\u001b[44Gmargin\u001b[51Gto\u001b[54G100\u001b[58Gm\u001b[60Gin\u001b[63Gthe\u001b[67Gfetched\u001b[75Gengine\u001b[82Gcopy\u001b[87Gand\u001b[91Greran.\u001b[98GShip2\u001b[104Gstill\u001b[110Govershot,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bto about 180 m,\u001b[19Gbu\u001b[22G swung back \u001b[35Gnd arrived 62 s\u001b[51Gafter the cruise \u001b[69Gnded,\u001b[75Gabout as long as other\u001b[98Garrivals take, and no\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bpad lapsed in the 25 mi\u001b[27Gutes. Both\u001b[38Gedits and the experim\u001b[60Gnt te\u001b[66Gt\u001b[68Gare reverted.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mProposed fix (Jettison, dock):\u001b[34G\u001b[22mwiden\u001b[40Gthe\u001b[44Gmargin\u001b[51Gso\u001b[54Gthat\u001b[59Gthe\u001b[63Gship's\u001b[70Garrival\u001b[78Gzone\u001b[83Gplus\u001b[88Ga\u001b[90Gfast\u001b[95Garrival's\u001b[105Govershoot\u001b[115Gstays\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
