\u001b[64Gtry happened not to overshoot.\u001b[95G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat I checked:\u001b[19G\u001b[22mI tempor\u001b[28Gril\u001b[32G raised the margin to 100 m in the fetch\u001b[73Gd engine copy and reran.\u001b[98GShip2\u001b[104Gstill\u001b[110Govershot,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bto\u001b[6Gabout\u001b[12G180\u001b[16Gm,\u001b[19Gbut\u001b[23Gswung\u001b[29Gback\u001b[34Gand\u001b[38Garrived\u001b[46G62\u001b[49Gs\u001b[51Gafter\u001b[57Gthe\u001b[61Gcruise\u001b[68Gended,\u001b[75Gabout\u001b[81Gas\u001b[84Glong\u001b[89Gas\u001b[92Gother\u001b[98Garrivals\u001b[107Gtake,\u001b[113Gand\u001b[117Gno\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bpad lapsed in the\u001b[21G25 minutes.\u001b[33GBoth edits\u001b[44Gand the experi\u001b[59Gent\u001b[64Gest are rev\u001b[76Grted.\u001b[82G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mProposed fix (Jettison, dock):\u001b[22m widen the\u001b[44Gmargin so that the\u001b[63Gship's ar\u001b[73Gi\u001b[75Gal zone\u001b[83Gplus\u001b[88Ga\u001b[90Gfast\u001b[95Garrival's\u001b[105Govershoot\u001b[115Gstays\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bclear\u001b[9Gof\u001b[12Gthe\u001b[16Gkeep-away\u001b[26Gzone.\u001b[32GI'd\u001b[36Gtie\u001b[40Gthe\u001b[44Gmargin\u001b[51Gto\u001b[54Gthe\u001b[58Gship's\u001b[65Gbraking\u001b[73Gdistance\u001b[82Grather\u001b[89Gthan\u001b[94Ga\u001b[96Gfixed\u001b[102Gnumber,\u001b[110Gand\u001b[114Gadd\u001b[118Ga\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdock test: an inbound ship round\u001b[36Gng the st\u001b[46Gtio\u001b[51Gfrom the far s\u001b[66Gde at full speed\u001b[83Gmust\u001b[89Grrive\u001b[95Gbefore the r\u001b[108Gserva\u001b[114Gion\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Blapses. I\u001b[13G changes flight paths,\u001b[36Gso the world-hash\u001b[54Gpins in Jettison an\u001b[74G Manif\u001b[81Gst's fix\u001b[90Gure\u001b[94Gpin will mov\u001b[107G, and I'll\u001b[118G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcheck that\u001b[14Go\u001b[16Gly those\u001b[25Gmoved. O\u001b[34Ge Jet\u001b[40Gison commit and\u001b[56G