[0.021, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe body the stati\u001b[22Gn orb\u001b[28Gts on rails. The ship is moved\u001b[59Ginto it\u001b[67Gwh\u001b[70Gn i\u001b[74Gs cruise ends (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mCruise.cpp:599\u001b[39m), and the docks\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bgive up any\u001b[15Gpad whose ship is in a different frame. The\u001b[59Gsta\u001b[63Gion doesn't spin (its angular velocity is\u001b[105G0). In\u001b[113Gystem\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcoordi\u001b[10Gates\u001b[15Geve\u001b[19Gything m\u001b[28Gves\u001b[32Gat\u001b[35Gabout 33 km/s,\u001b[50Gbut that is\u001b[62Gthe\u001b[66Gbody's\u001b[73Gown\u001b[77Gorbit;\u001b[84Ginside\u001b[91Gthe\u001b[95Gframe\u001b[101Gthe\u001b[105Gship's\u001b[112Gspeeds\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bare\u001b[7Gtens\u001b[12Gof\u001b[15Gmetres\u001b[22Ga\u001b[24Gsecond.\u001b[32GSo\u001b[35Gthe\u001b[39Gframes\u001b[46Gare\u001b[50Gconsistent.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat goes wrong:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GT\u001b[7Ge docks\u001b[16Gly an inbound ship t\u001b[37G a point above its pad. That point is\u001b[75Gonly 10 m outside\u001b[94Ghe zone steering keeps the\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bsh\u001b[8Gp away f\u001b[17Gom around the station (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mkAboveMargin = 10.0\u001b[39m in\u001b[63G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mDocks.cpp\u001b[39m). The ship\u001b[84Gonly\u001b[89Ghas\u001b[93Gto\u001b[96Gget\u001b[100Gwithin\u001b[107G20\u001b[110Gm\u001b[112Gof\u001b[115Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gpo\u001b[8Gnt\u001b[11Gto arrive, s\u001b[24G the arrival zone already\u001b[51Geaches into the keep-away zone.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GShip2 reached Ore\u001b[23Gon the\u001b[30Gfar side, so it\u001b[46Gw\u001b[48Gs routed around the st\u001b[71Gtion\u001b[76Gthrough a\u001b[86Gwaypoint. It came off\u001b[108Gthe\u001b[112Gwaypoint\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gat abou\u001b[13G 100 m/s\u001b[23Gmov\u001b[27Gng sideways to\u001b[42Gthe target,\u001b[54Gand\u001b[58Govershot by\u001b[70Gabout\u001b[76G50 m into the\u001b[90Gke\u001b[93Gp-away zone.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GI\u001b[7Gside\u001b[12Gthat\u001b[17Gzon\u001b[21G, avoidance commands up to\u001b[48Gabout\u001b[54G190 m/s outward while arrival pulls the ship back in. That\u001b[113Gputs\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Benergy back in \u001b[21Gvery\u001b[29G: the\u001b[35Gship\u001b[40Gcircled\u001b[48G30–55\u001b[54Gm\u001b[56Gfrom\u001b[61Gthe\u001b[65Gpoint\u001b[71Gat\u001b[74Gabout\u001b[80G40\u001b[83Gm/s\u001b[87Gfor\u001b[91Gthe\u001b[95Gpad's\u001b[101Gfull\u001b[106G300\u001b[110Gs,\u001b[113Gnever\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Garrived, and the pad l\u001b[28Gpsed.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GShip1\u001b[11Gcame\u001b[16Gin\u001b[19Gthrough\u001b[27Ga\u001b[29Gwaypoint\u001b[38Gtoo\u001b[42Gand\u001b[46Garrived;\u001b[55Gits\u001b[59Ggeometry\u001b[68Ghappened\u001b[77Gnot\u001b[81Gto\u001b[84Govershoot.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat I checked:\u001b[19G\u001b[22mI \u001b[22Gemporarily r\u001b[35Gised the margin\u001b[51Gto 100 m in the f\u001b[69Gtched\u001b[75Gengine copy and reran.\u001b[98GShip2 still overshot,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bto about 180 m, but swu\u001b[27Gg back and\u001b[38Garrived 62 s after th\u001b[60G crui\u001b[66Ge\u001b[68Gended, about as\u001b[84Glong\u001b[89Gas\u001b[92Gother\u001b[98Garrivals\u001b[107Gtake,\u001b[113Gand\u001b[117Gno\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bpad\u001b[7Glapsed\u001b[14Gin\u001b[17Gthe\u001b[21G25\u001b[24Gminutes.\u001b[33GBoth\u001b[38Gedits\u001b[44Gand\u001b[48Gthe\u001b[52Gexperiment\u001b[63Gtest\u001b[68Gare\u001b[72Greverted.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B                              \u001b[34G     \u001b[40G   \u001b[44G   \u001b[76G\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
