[0.004, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G-\u001b[5GShip1 came in through a waypoint to\u001b[42Gand\u001b[46Gar\u001b[49Gived; its g\u001b[61Gometry happened not\u001b[81Gto \u001b[85Gvershoot.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat I checked:\u001b[22m I t\u001b[23Gmpor\u001b[28Grily raised\u001b[40Gthe margin to\u001b[54G100 m in the fe\u001b[70Gched engine copy\u001b[87Gand\u001b[91Greran. Ship2 still\u001b[110Govershot,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bto about 180 m, but swung back\u001b[34Gand\u001b[38Garrived\u001b[46G62\u001b[49Gs\u001b[51Gafter\u001b[57Gthe\u001b[61Gcruise\u001b[68Gended,\u001b[75Gabout\u001b[81Gas\u001b[84Glong\u001b[89Gas\u001b[92Gother\u001b[98Garrivals\u001b[107Gtake,\u001b[113Gand\u001b[117Gno\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bpad lapsed in the 25 minutes. Both\u001b[38Gedits and the experiment test\u001b[68Gare reverted.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[1mProposed fix (Jettison, dock):\u001b[22m w\u001b[36Gd\u001b[38Gn\u001b[51Gs\u001b[54Gthat the\u001b[63Gs\u001b[65Gip's arrival zone plus a fast arrival's overshoot stays\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcle\u001b[7Gr of\u001b[12Gthe\u001b[16Gkeep-away zone. I'd tie the margin\u001b[51Gto the ship's braking distance rather\u001b[89Gthan a fixed number, and a\u001b[116Gd a\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdock te\u001b[11Gt:\u001b[14Ga\u001b[17Ginbound ship rounding the station from the far side at\u001b[72Gfull speed\u001b[83Gmust\u001b[88Garrive\u001b[95Gbefore\u001b[102Gthe\u001b[106Greservation\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Blapses.\u001b[11GIt\u001b[14Gchanges\u001b[22Gflight\u001b[29Gpaths,\u001b[36Gso\u001b[39Gthe\u001b[43Gworld-hash\u001b[54Gpins\u001b[59Gin\u001b[62GJettison\u001b[71Gand\u001b[75GManifest's\u001b[86Gfixture\u001b[94Gpin\u001b[98Gwill\u001b[103Gmove,\u001b[109Gand\u001b[113GI'll\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcheck that only those moved. One J\u001b[38Gttison commit and one Manifest comm\u001b[74Gt, each with the ga\u001b[94Ge g\u001b[98Geen.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BShould I do th\u001b[18Gs fix before L28, or\u001b[39Grecord it and go\u001b[56Gstraight to L28?\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI haven't checked wh\u001b[24Gther a 100 m margin causes other problems, su\u001b[70Gh as pads near a\u001b[87Gneighbouring body\u001b[105Gor\u001b[108Gdisplay\u001b[116Gpads.\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GChurned for 7m 20s · done 3:59 pm\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mHow is this handled in other space games with ship docking?\u001b[39m                                                           \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✶\u001b[3GThunde\u001b[38;2;235;159;127mrin\u001b[38;2;215;119;87mg… \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[38C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
