[0.350, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mAssisted manual docking (Elite Dangerous):\u001b[48G\u001b[22myou request\u001b[60Gpe\u001b[63Gmissio\u001b[71Gand get a\u001b[81Gpad, and\u001b[90Gthe\u001b[94Gpermission\u001b[105Glapses\u001b[112Gif\u001b[115Gyou\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gdon't land in time; that's the same role as \u001b[51Gr res\u001b[57Grvation. A speed limit a\u001b[82Gplies near th\u001b[96G stat\u001b[104G, \u001b[107Gnd the docking\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bc\u001b[7Gmputer fl\u001b[17Ges a fixed approach in through the entrance.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mGeneral autopilot (Space Engineers):\u001b[22m the remote-control autopilot\u001b[71Gis\u001b[74Gknown\u001b[80Gfor\u001b[84Gcircling\u001b[93Gor\u001b[96Govershooting\u001b[109Gits\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gwaypoints. Players work around it with a\u001b[46Gslow precisi\u001b[59Gn\u001b[61Gmode or \u001b[70Gheir own scripts. That\u001b[93Gis\u001b[97Gur failure,\u001b[109Gand\u001b[113Gthe\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Breas\u001b[10Gn \u001b[13Ghe\u001b[16Gothers constr\u001b[30Gin the last leg.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThese\u001b[9Ggames\u001b[15Gcombine\u001b[23Gfour\u001b[28Gtechniques:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B1. \u001b[1mMake the final approach one-dimensional.\u001b[47G\u001b[22mBring\u001b[53Gthe\u001b[57Gship\u001b[62Gto\u001b[65Ga\u001b[67Gpoint\u001b[73Gout\u001b[77Galong\u001b[83Gthe\u001b[87Gpad's\u001b[93Gnormal\u001b[100Gand\u001b[104Gcome\u001b[109Gin\u001b[112Gstraight,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gso any overshoot heads toward or away from the\u001b[53Gstation rather than\u001b[73Gsideways into\u001b[87Gan orbit.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mDon't treat the destination as an obstacle on the final leg.\u001b[22m We \u001b[71Glrea\u001b[76Gy do this when descending\u001b[102G(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mbyHull\u001b[39m),\u001b[112Gbut\u001b[116Gnot\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gon the inbound leg.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C