ers work around it with a\u001b[46Gslow precisi\u001b[59Gn\u001b[61Gmode or \u001b[70Gheir own scripts. That\u001b[93Gis\u001b[97Gur failure,\u001b[109Gand\u001b[113Gthe\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Breas\u001b[10Gn \u001b[13Ghe\u001b[16Gothers constr\u001b[30Gin the last leg.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThese\u001b[9Ggames\u001b[15Gcombine\u001b[23Gfour\u001b[28Gtechniques:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B1. \u001b[1mMake the final approach one-dimensional.\u001b[47G\u001b[22mBring\u001b[53Gthe\u001b[57Gship\u001b[62Gto\u001b[65Ga\u001b[67Gpoint\u001b[73Gout\u001b[77Galong\u001b[83Gthe\u001b[87Gpad's\u001b[93Gnormal\u001b[100Gand\u001b[104Gcome\u001b[109Gin\u001b[112Gstraight,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gso any overshoot heads toward or away from the\u001b[53Gstation rather than\u001b[73Gsideways into\u001b[87Gan orbit.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mDon't treat the destination as an obstacle on the final leg.\u001b[22m We \u001b[71Glrea\u001b[76Gy do this when descending\u001b[102G(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mbyHull\u001b[39m),\u001b[112Gbut\u001b[116Gnot\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gon the inbound leg.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mSlow down near the station.\u001b[34G\u001b[22mArrive\u001b[41Gslowly\u001b[77Ganything.\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
