[0.021, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gitself on the final leg. Stuck or circling\u001b[48Gships still\u001b[60Gtu\u001b[63Gn up i\u001b[71Gtheir bug\u001b[81Greports.\u001b[90G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mAssisted manual docking (Elite Dangerous):\u001b[22m y\u001b[51G requ\u001b[57Gst permission and get a \u001b[82Gad, and the p\u001b[96Grmiss\u001b[104G l\u001b[107Gpses if you\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bd\u001b[7Gn't land \u001b[17Gn time; that's the same role as our reservation.\u001b[66GA\u001b[68Gspeed\u001b[74Glimit\u001b[80Gapplies\u001b[88Gnear\u001b[93Gthe\u001b[97Gstation,\u001b[106Gand\u001b[110Gthe\u001b[114Gdocking\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gcomputer flies a fixed approach in through the entrance.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mGeneral autopilot (Space Engineers):\u001b[22m the\u001b[46Gremote-contr\u001b[59Gl\u001b[61Gautopilo\u001b[70G is known for circling\u001b[93Gor\u001b[97Gvershooting\u001b[109Gits\u001b[113G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bwayp\u001b[10Gin\u001b[13Gs.\u001b[16GPlayers work \u001b[30Ground it with a slow\u001b[51Gprecision\u001b[61Gmode\u001b[66Gor\u001b[69Gtheir\u001b[75Gown\u001b[79Gscripts.\u001b[88GThat\u001b[93Gis\u001b[96Gour\u001b[100Gfailure,\u001b[109Gand\u001b[113Gthe\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Breason\u001b[12Gthe\u001b[16Gothers\u001b[23Gconstrain\u001b[33Gthe\u001b[37Glast\u001b[42Gleg.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThese games combine four techniques:\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B1.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mMake the final approach one-dimensional.\u001b[22m Bring\u001b[53Gthe ship to a point\u001b[73Gout along the\u001b[87Gpad's normal\u001b[100Gand\u001b[104Gcome\u001b[109Gin\u001b[112Gstraight,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gso any overshoot heads toward or away from the station rather th\u001b[71Gn si\u001b[76Geways into an orbit.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mDon't treat the destination as an obstacle on the final leg.\u001b[67G\u001b[22mWe\u00