[0.005, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H     on the inbound leg.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mSlow down near the station.\u001b[22m Arrive slowly enough to stop well short of anything.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mLapse a pad only when the ship isn't progressing.\u001b[56G\u001b[22mThen\u001b[61Ga\u001b[63Gslow\u001b[68Gbut\u001b[72Gworking\u001b[80Garrival\u001b[88Gkeeps\u001b[94Gits\u001b[98Gpad,\u001b[103Gand\u001b[107Ga\u001b[109Gstuck\u001b[115Gone\u001b[119Gis\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   dropped.\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat I'd do for us:\u001b[23G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[27Gfirst\u001b[33Gtechnique,\u001b[44Gin\u001b[47GJettison's\u001b[58Gdocks.\u001b[65GAdd\u001b[69Gan\u001b[72Gapproach\u001b[81Gpoint\u001b[87Gon\u001b[90Gthe\u001b[94Gpad's\u001b[100Gnormal,\u001b[108Gbeyond\u001b[115Gthe\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gabove-pad poin\u001b[19Gby more than the ship's\u001b[43Gbraking dista\u001b[57Gce. The inbound course goes through it,\u001b[97Gso the \u001b[105Gast leg is\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bstraight down\u001b[17Gthe normal, and the\u001b[37G10\u001b[40Gm m\u001b[44Grgin\u001b[49Gcan\u001b[53Gstay\u001b[58Gas\u001b[61Git\u001b[64Gis.\u001b[68GThis\u001b[73Gremoves\u001b[81Gthe\u001b[85Gsideways\u001b[94Govershoot\u001b[104Gthat\u001b[109Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bavoidance\u001b[13Gkept\u001b[18Gpumping,\u001b[27Grather\u001b[34Gthan\u001b[39Gmoving\u001b[46Gthe\u001b[50Gmargin\u001b[57Guntil\u001b[63Gthis\u001b[68Gcase\u001b[73Gpasses.\u001b[81GIt\u001b[84Gis\u001b[87Gstill\u001b[93Ga\u001b[95Gfix\u001b[99Ginside\u001b[106Gour\u001b[110Gown\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bphysical docking, so the docks' outward behaviour is unchanged.\u001b[67GI'd l\u001b[73Gave the speed\u001b[87Glimit\u001b[94Gnd progress-based lapsing\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfor\u001b[7Glater unless the\u001b[24Gtest \u001b[30Gh\u001b[32Gws they're needed.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe p\u001b[10G and\u001b[15Ggate cost is the\u001b[32Gsame as for\u001b[44Gthe margin fix: the hash pins i\u001b[77Gboth repo\u001b[87G move.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCrunched for 24s · done 4:03 pm\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mMake a note of your findings and your recollection of issues with other games docking system. We will use your \u001b[39m       \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255msuggested fix right now, and return to the issue at a later date with a quality solution. Add it to the roadmap, \u001b[39m     \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mselect the priority it deserves. Do the fix now and then we\u001b[63Gsta\u001b[67Gt o\u001b[71G the\u001b[76Gnext step.\u001b[39m                                   \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m·\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;215;119;87mSmooshing… \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── jettison-0010 ─\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[38C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
