[0.019, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat I'd do for us:\u001b[23G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[27Gfirst\u001b[33Gtechnique,\u001b[44Gin\u001b[47GJettison's\u001b[58Gdocks.\u001b[65GAdd\u001b[69Gan\u001b[72Gapproach\u001b[81Gpoint\u001b[87Gon\u001b[90Gthe\u001b[94Gpad's\u001b[100Gnormal,\u001b[108Gbeyond\u001b[115Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Babove-pad point by mor\u001b[27Gthan th\u001b[35G sh\u001b[39Gp's braking distance. The\u001b[65Ginbou\u001b[71Gd course goes \u001b[86Ghroug\u001b[92G it, so\u001b[100Gthe last leg is\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bstraight down \u001b[18Ghe normal, \u001b[31Gd the 10 m ma\u001b[45Ggin can \u001b[56Gy as\u001b[61Git is. This\u001b[73Gremov\u001b[79Gs the\u001b[85Gsideways overshoot\u001b[104Gtha\u001b[109Gthe\u001b[113G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bavoidance kept pumping, rather than moving the margin until this\u001b[68Gcase\u001b[73Gpasses.\u001b[81GIt i\u001b[86G still a fix inside our own\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bphysical docking, so the docks' outward behaviour is unchanged. I'd leave the\u001b[81Gspeed\u001b[87Glimit\u001b[94Gnd progress-based lapsing\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfor later unless the\u001b[25Gest shows\u001b[35Gthey'\u001b[41Ge\u001b[43Gn\u001b[45Geded.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe\u001b[7Gpin\u001b[11Gand\u001b[15Ggate\u001b[20Gcost\u001b[25Gis\u001b[28Gthe\u001b[32Gsame\u001b[37Gas\u001b[40Gfor\u001b[44Gthe\u001b[48Gmargin\u001b[55Gfix:\u001b[60Gthe\u001b[64Ghash\u001b[69Gpins\u001b[74Gin\u001b[77Gboth\u001b[82Grepos\u001b[88Gmove.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCrunched for 24s · done 4:03 pm\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mMake a note of your findings and your recollection of issues with other games docking system. We will use your \u001b[39m       \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255msuggested fix right\u001b[23Gnow, and\u001b[32Greturn to the issue