he poin\u001b[46Gabove i\u001b[54Gs pad, only 10 m outs\u001b[76Gde what\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[2m 5 \u001b[22msteering\u001b[18Gke\u001b[21Gps it from,\u001b[33Gand avoidanc\u001b[46G pushed it out\u001b[61Geach\u001b[66Glap\u001b[70Gwhile\u001b[76GArrive\u001b[83Gpulled\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 6 \u001b[22mit\u001b[12Gback,\u001b[18Gso\u001b[21Git\u001b[24Gcircled\u001b[32Gthe\u001b[36Gpoint\u001b[42Guntil\u001b[48Gits\u001b[52Greservation\u001b[64Glapsed.\u001b[72GThe\u001b[76Gcourse\u001b[83Gnow\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 7 \u001b[22mends\u001b[14Gat a po\u001b[22Gnt out along the normal as f\u001b[51Gr beyond as\u001b[63Gthe\u001b[67Gship\u001b[72Gstops\u001b[78Gin\u001b[81Gfrom\u001b[86Gits\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 8 \u001b[22mtop speed (Ai::BrakingAcceleration, steering's own), where it stops, and the way\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 9 \u001b[22mon to the point\u001b[25Gabove\u001b[31Gis\u001b[34Gstraight\u001b[43Gdown\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
