[0.125, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 148 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  the solution: an approach corridor flown without stopping, at a speed that falls with the           \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 149 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  distance left; the station not an obstacle on the corridor's last leg, as it is not on the way      \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 150 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  down (`byHull`); Arrive damping the velocity across its line rather than pursuing; and a            \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 151 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  reservation that lapses when a ship stops making progress rather than at a fixed time. Measured by  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 152 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  ships flown in from every side and speed, one queued behind another on the next pad, and no         \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 153 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  arrival slower than the stopgap's.                                                                  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 154 \u001b[12G\u001b[22m-\u001b[14G**A\u001b[18Gtest\u001b[23Gof\u001b[26Gan\u001b[29Gacquire\u001b[37Gout\u001b[41Gof\u001b[44Gdate\u001b[49Gtwice**\u001b[57G(the\u001b[62Guser's,\u001b[70G2026-11-18).\u001b[83G`drawEveryFrame`'s\u001b[102Grecreate\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 155 \u001b[22m   loop and its failure aft\u001b[40G eight are not cover\u001b[61Gd: it\u001b[67Gneeds fault injection under the Vulkan\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 156 \u001b[14G\u001b[22mlayer,\u001b[21Gwhich\u001b[27Gthe\u001b[31Gengine\u001b[38Gdoes\u001b[43Gnot\u001b[47Ghave.\u001b[53GTaken\u001b[59Gup\u001b[62Gwhen\u001b[67Gthat\u001b[72Gbranch\u001b[79Gis\u001b[82Gneeded,\u001b[90Gif\u001b[93Gever.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[