[0.005, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded\u001b[12G\u001b[1m3\u001b[14G\u001b[22mlines, removed \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m lines\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m1\u001b[10G3 \u001b[14G\u001b[22m straight\u001b[24Gafter,\u001b[31Gon\u001b[34Ga\u001b[36Gdocked\u001b[43Gfleet\u001b[49Gstopping\u001b[58Gthe\u001b[62Gfast-forward.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 1034 \u001b[22m - **Left.** Scouting an unknown market, a standing route and Wasm policies; the charges' real amounts\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m      \u001b[22m  and the\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 1035 \u001b[22m   ones not yet charged (W18); and observation running every step while a fleet is docked, which a doc\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m   \u001b[11G \u001b[13G\u001b[22mked NPC keeps doing\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 1036 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  (L28). Not yet diagnosed: in the zero-client run Ada's ship spends its pad's whole 300 s           \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m 1037 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  reservation arriving at Ore and fails as `PadLost`, where every other arrival takes about 70 s.    \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 1036 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  (L28). A ship flown in to a pad stops out along its normal first, Jettison's stopgap for one that  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 1037 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  circled its pad until the pad lapsed, as Ada's did at Ore in the zero-client run; the quality      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 1038 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  solution is Jettison's ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mroadmap\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](../../jettison/docs/roadmap.md#then-robustness-tools-and-what-a-m\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m      +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mod-can-reach)).                                                                                      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 1039 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 1040 \u001b[22m ## Handoff to stage 5\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m1041 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2BSearching for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern, running \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m sh\u001b[41Gll command…\u001b[K\r\u001b[14C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m24m 34s · ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m40.5k tokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[18C\u001b[6B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
