[0.039, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[2m 1033 \u001b[15G\u001b[22mstraight\u001b[24Gafter,\u001b[31Gon\u001b[34Ga\u001b[36Gdocked\u001b[43Gfleet\u001b[49Gstopping\u001b[58Gthe\u001b[62Gfast-forward.\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 1034 \u001b[22m - **Left.** Scouting an\u001b[37Gunknown\u001b[45Gmarket,\u001b[53Ga\u001b[55Gstanding\u001b[64Groute\u001b[70Gand\u001b[74GWasm\u001b[79Gpolicies;\u001b[89Gthe\u001b[93Gcharges'\u001b[102Greal\u001b[107Gamounts\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[14G\u001b[22mand the\u001b[K\r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m5\u001b[13G\u001b[22m \u001b[15Gones not yet char\u001b[33Ged (W18); and observ\u001b[54Gtion ru\u001b[62Gning every step whi\u001b[82Ge a fleet is docked, which a doc\r\u001b[12C\u001b[1Bked NPC keeps\u001b[27Gdoing\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 1036 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  (L28). Not yet diagnosed: in the zero-client run Ada's ship spends its pad's whole 300 s           \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m 1037 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  reservation arriving at Ore and fails as `PadLost`, where every other arrival takes about 70 s.    \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 1036 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  (L28). A ship flown in to a pad stops out along its normal first, Jettison's stopgap for one that  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 1037 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  circled its pad until the pad lapsed, as Ada's did at Ore in the zero-client run; the quality      \r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m8\u001b[15G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242msolution\u001b[24Gis Jettison's\u001b[38G([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mroadmap\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](../../jettison/docs/roadmap.md#then-robustness-tools-and-what-a-m\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m    \u001b[13G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mod-can-reach)).  \u001b[31G     \u001b[37G   \u001b[41G   \u001b[45G       \u001b[53G  \u001b[56G     \u001b[62G   \u001b[66G  \u001b[69G   \u001b[73G  \u001b[76G   \u00