 slowing as the dis\u001b[69Gance closes;\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bvoidance relaxed against the sta\u001b[39Gion on the\u001b[50Gfinal leg;\u001b[61G\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bn arrival th\u001b[19Gt \u001b[22Gamps sideways mo\u001b[42G;\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Brese\u001b[10Gvations that lapse only when a ship\u001b[46Gstops\u001b[52Gmaking\u001b[59Gprogress.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mDecision needed: the push.\u001b[30G\u001b[22mNeither\u001b[38Grepo\u001b[43Gis\u001b[46Gpushed.\u001b[54GManifest's\u001b[65Gpin\u001b[69Gpoints\u001b[76Gat\u001b[79Ga\u001b[81GJettison\u001b[90Gcommit\u001b[97Gthat\u001b[102Gisn't\u001b[108Gon\u001b[111GGitHub.\u001b[119GI\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcopied it by hand into each local build's Jettison\u001b[54Gcopy so the gate could run, bu\u001b[85G a fresh clone of Manifest won't\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bnfigure\u001b[13Guntil Jettison \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfeature-base\u001b[39m is pus\u001b[76Go\u001b[78G will you?\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
