[0.002, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mCommitted \u001b[1mf72c906\u001b[22m, ran \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m shell commands \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mL28\u001b[7Gis\u001b[10Gdone\u001b[15Gand\u001b[19Gcommitted\u001b[29Gas\u001b[32GManifest\u001b[41G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mf72c906\u001b[49G\u001b[39mon\u001b[52G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfeature-base\u001b[39m,\u001b[66Gwith\u001b[71Gthe\u001b[75Ggate\u001b[80Ggreen.\u001b[87GShips\u001b[93Gnow\u001b[97Gdon't\u001b[103Ghave\u001b[108Gto\u001b[111Gstep\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gthrough ev\u001b[14Gry se\u001b[21Gnd \u001b[25Gh\u001b[27Gy\u001b[29Gspend docked.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThe fix:\u001b[12G\u001b[22ma\u001b[14Gdocked\u001b[21Gship's\u001b[28Gmarket\u001b[35Greport\u001b[42Gonly\u001b[47Gchanges\u001b[55Gwhen\u001b[60Gsomething\u001b[70Gwakes\u001b[76Gthe\u001b[80Gworld\u001b[86Ganyway\u001b[93G(a\u001b[96Gtrade,\u001b[103Gan\u001b[106Gorder\u001b[112Gexpiring,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Ba ship docking or\u001b[21Gleaving), or by the clock\u001b[47G(the sales window's edge, an\u001b[76Gorder lapsi\u001b[88Gg). So observation no longer\u001b[K\r\u001b[3C\u001b[1Bsks for any step. When steps are\u001b[37Gskipped, it r\u001b[51Gbui\u001b[55Gd\u001b[58Geach dock\u001b[69G ship's \u001b[78Geport once, as the last skipped\u001b[110Gstep would\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bhave. The only code change i\u001b[33Gin \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mTrade.cpp\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mEvidence:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- \u001b[1mDocked test:\u001b[18G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[22Gfixture's\u001b[32Gfast-forwarded\u001b[47Gcruise\u001b[54Gnow\u001b[58Gcarries\u001b[66Gon\u001b[69Gfor\u001b[73Gan\u001b[76Ghour\u001b[81Gdocked\u001b[88Gat\u001b[91GBrine,\u001b[98Gand\u001b[102Gevery\u001b[108Gstop\u001b[113Gmatches\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gthe stepped world by\u001b[26Ge for\u001b[32Gbyte. That hour takes\u001b[54G6 calls; with the old\u001b[76Gc\u001b[78Gde\u001b[81Git took 3,600 (checked by pu\u001b[110Gting \u001b[116Ghe\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bold\u001b[9Gcode back).\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mNo hash moved:\u001b[22m every\u001b[26Gpinned\u001b[33Ghash\u001b[38Gis\u001b[41Gunchanged,\u001b[52Gthe\u001b[56Gzero-client\u001b[68Grun's\u001b[74Gincluded.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat the zero-client run actually shows:\u001b[44G\u001b[22mit\u001b[47Gcan't\u001b[53Gbe\u001b[56Gthe\u001b[60Gevidence\u001b[69Gthe\u001b[73GL28\u001b[77Grow\u001b[81Gnamed.\u001b[88GIt\u001b[91Gis\u001b[94Gstill\u001b[100G42,483\u001b[107Gcalls\u001b[113Gfor\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B90,000 steps. I instrumented the fast-forward temporarily: what single-steps it is Jet\u001b[90Gison's steering,\u001b[107Gwhich\u001b[113Gblocks\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B67\u001b[6G866\u001b[17GEvery docked wait,\u001b[36Gincluding Nia's blocked one, falls while the other ship is departing, clearing \u001b[116Gr\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcoming\u001b[10Gin near a station, which steering has\u001b[76Gcruises get skipped. I \u001b[100Gecorded this in the\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
