[0.034, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat the zero-client run actually shows:\u001b[44G\u001b[22mit\u001b[47Gcan't\u001b[53Gbe\u001b[56Gthe\u001b[60Gevidence\u001b[69Gthe\u001b[73GL28\u001b[77Grow\u001b[81Gnamed.\u001b[88GIt\u001b[91Gis\u001b[94Gstill\u001b[100G42,483\u001b[107Gcalls\u001b[113Gfor\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B90,000 steps. I instrumented the fast-forward temporarily: what single-steps it is Jet\u001b[90Gison's steering,\u001b[107Gwhich\u001b[113Gblocks\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B67\u001b[6G866\u001b[17GEvery docked wait,\u001b[36Gincluding Nia's blocked one, falls while the other ship is departing, clearing \u001b[116Gr\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcoming\u001b[10Gin near a station, which steering has to fly ev\u001b[58Gry step. Only the cruises get skipped. I \u001b[100Gecorded this in the\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdel\u001b[7Gvered\u001b[13Gs\u001b[15Gction and i\u001b[27G history, and the evidence mo\u001b[58Gd to the\u001b[67Gdocked test above. If that run's spee\u001b[105G ma\u001b[109Gters, the\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bn\u001b[5Gxt gain\u001b[13Gis in Jettiso\u001b[27G: shorter\u001b[37Gor skippable flight near s\u001b[64Gations, which ties into the quality\u001b[100Gdocking solution on\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe ro\u001b[10Gdmap.\u001b[16G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mNext:\u001b[9G\u001b[22mclosing\u001b[17GW10,\u001b[22Gwhich\u001b[28Gis\u001b[31Gdocs\u001b[36Gonly:\u001b[42Gits\u001b[46Grow,\u001b[51Gits\u001b[55Gdelivered\u001b[65Gsection,\u001b[74GD-097's\u001b[82Gstatus,\u001b[90Gand\u001b[94GJettison's\u001b[105Groadmap\u001b[113Gand\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bhistory. So\u001b[15Gnet at\u001b[22Gmedium eff\u001b[33Grt\u001b[36Gis enough\u001b[46Gf\u001b[48Gr that\u001b[55Gand won't\u001b[65Ghur\u001b[69G code quality. Push M\u001b[92Gifes\u001b[97G whe\u001b[102G you're ready;\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BJet\u001b[7Gison\u001b[12Gis unch\u001b[20Gnged.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BSkipped:\u001b[12GI\u001b[14Gdid\u001b[18Gnot\u001b[22Gadd\u001b[26Ga\u001b[28Gseparate\u001b[37Gtest\u001b[42Gfor\u001b[46Gan\u001b[49Gorder\u001b[55Gexpiring\u001b[64Gin\u001b[67Gthe\u001b[71Gmiddle\u001b[78Gof\u001b[81Ga\u001b[83Gskipped\u001b[91Gstretch.\u001b[100GIt\u001b[103Grelies\u001b[110Gon\u001b[113Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bgeneral fast-forward-versus-stepped compa\u001b[45Gisons. The diagnost\u001b[65Gc\u001b[67Ghacks in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m_deps\u001b[39m and \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mFixtureTests.cpp\u001b[103G\u001b[39mare reverted.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCogitated for 14m 9s · done 4:58 pm\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mcontinue\u001b[39m                                                                                                              \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m                                              \u001b[76G\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
