[0.006, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI've\u001b[8Gread\u001b[13GW18's\u001b[19Grow\u001b[23Gand\u001b[27Gthe\u001b[31Gcharges\u001b[39GW10\u001b[43Gleft\u001b[48Gbehind,\u001b[56Gand\u001b[60GI\u001b[62Gneed\u001b[67Gyour\u001b[72Ganswers\u001b[80Gon\u001b[83Gits\u001b[87Gfour\u001b[92Gopen\u001b[97Gchoices\u001b[105Gbefore\u001b[112GI\u001b[114Gplan.\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3GFor scale, one run of W15's furs\u001b[36Gturns\u001b[42G25,000\u001b[49Gcredits\u001b[57Ginto\u001b[62G29,590,\u001b[70Gso\u001b[73Git\u001b[76Gmakes\u001b[82Gabout\u001b[88G4,600.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\r\u001b[1B────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B← \u001b[48;2;177;185;249m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m ☐ Docking fee \u001b[39m\u001b[49m ☐ Berth fee  ☐ Arrears  ☐ Transit LS  ✔ Submit  →\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mWhat should a venue's docking fee be based on, and how much? (Today it is a flat 10 credits, paid as a journey to the \r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mvenue starts. A furs run makes about 4,600.)\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m❯\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m1.\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mBy pad size (Recommended)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mThe v\u001b[13Gu\u001b[15G posts\u001b[22Gone fee per pad class, skiff to cruiser, and a ship pays its berth's class. The starter's skiff pad\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bdefaults to 100 credits, and the classes above it rise with pad area.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m2.\u001b[39m Flat per venue\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mOne fee per venue for any ship, defaulting to 100 credits. The simplest option; a small ship and a big one pay the \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153msam\u001b[10G.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m3.\u001b[6G\u001b[39mBy\u001b[9Ghull\u001b[14Gmass\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mA rate per tonne of the hull: about 5 credits a tonne, so 100 for the 20 t starter. Scales smoothly, but cargo mass\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153misn't counted.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m4.\u001b[6G\u001b[39mKeep\u001b[11G10,\u001b[15Gbasis\u001b[21Gonly\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mLeave the\u001b[16Gamounts nominal for now and only add the operator's command. Balancing comes later.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B5. Type something.\r\u001b[1B────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  6.\u001b[6GChat\u001b[11Gabout\u001b[17Gthis\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mEnter to select · Tab/Arrow keys to navigate · Esc to cancel\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── jettison-0010 ─\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[11;1H"]
