[0.005, "o", "\u001b[H\r\u001b[17C\u001b[5B ☒ Berth fee \u001b[48;2;177;185;249m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m ☐ Arrears \r\u001b[7C\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mhappens when a company\u001b[31Gcan't pay its b\u001b[47Grth\u001b[51Garr\u001b[55Gars? (Today\u001b[67Gthe arrears ar\u001b[82G take\u001b[88G first each hour and must be \u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mfully paid before \u001b[22Ghe s\u001b[27Gip can leave, so the ship is already held.)\r\u001b[5C\u001b[2B\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mHeld,\u001b[12Gthen cargo s\u001b[25Gized (R\u001b[33Gcommended)\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mThe ship can't\u001b[21Gleave, as now. After a grace period (def\u001b[62Gult 7 simulation \u001b[80Gays), the venue takes and sells\u001b[112Genough of\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bthe ship's\u001b[17Gca\u001b[20Ggo\u001b[23Gat its market\u001b[37Gto clear th\u001b[49G debt.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1BHeld only\u001b[16G\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mKeep things as\u001b[21Gthey \u001b[27Gre: the sh\u001b[38Gp stays\u001b[46Gdocked and the\u001b[61Gdebt\u001b[66Gkeeps com\u001b[76Gounding until the company pays. Nothing else \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mhappens.\u001b[15G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m3.\u001b[6G\u001b[39mHeld, life support cut\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mAft\u001b[10Gr th\u001b[15G grace period the station disconnects the ship's life support, so it runs on its own tanks. That raises \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mthe stakes without any seizure logic.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m4. Type something.\r\u001b[1B────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  5. Chat about this\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mEnter to select · Tab/Arrow keys to navigate · Esc to cancel\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[11;1H"]
