[0.005, "o", "\u001b[H\r\u001b[30C\u001b[5B ☒ Arrears \u001b[48;2;177;185;249m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m ☐ Transit LS \r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mHow s\u001b[9Gould the life\u001b[23Gsup\u001b[27Gort\u001b[31Ga ship uses in t\u001b[48Gansit (oxygen and cartridg\u001b[75G wear) be costed and \u001b[97Gttrib\u001b[103Gted to a lot?\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m❯\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m1.\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mAt its own cost (Recommended)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G  \u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mWhat the company paid for the oxygen and cartridges consumed during a lot's journeys is added to that lot's \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bc\u001b[8Garges,\u001b[15Gthe sam\u001b[23G way\u001b[28Gfees are, so the lot's sale floor recovers it.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m2.\u001b[6G\u001b[39mAt market price\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mUse the current ask at the venue where the ship next refills. Closer to replacement cost, but it moves with prices.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3.\u001b[6G\u001b[39mNot attributed\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mTreat it as company overhead. Lots carry fees only, and estimates leave life support out.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4\u001b[5G Type something.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m5.\u001b[6GChat about this\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mEnter to select · Tab/Arrow keys to navigate · Esc to cancel\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[10;1H"]
