[0.035, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  R\u001b[8Gferenced\u001b[17Gfile\u001b[22G\u001b[1mdocs/roadmap.md\r\u001b[1C\u001b[2B\u001b[22m\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mStart on W18\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m15\u001b[22m patterns, read \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, ran \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands · \u001b[38;2;255;107;128m2 failed\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m I've read W18's row and the charges W10 left behind, and I need\u001b[67Gyour\u001b[72Ganswers\u001b[80Gon\u001b[83Gits\u001b[87Gfour\u001b[92Gopen\u001b[97Gchoices\u001b[105Gbefore\u001b[112GI\u001b[114Gplan.\r\u001b[1B  For scale, one run of W15's furs turns\u001b[42G25,000\u001b[49Gcredits\u001b[57Ginto\u001b[62G29,590,\u001b[70Gso\u001b[73Git\u001b[76Gmakes\u001b[82Gabout\u001b[88G4,600.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mAnswered\u001b[12GClaude's\u001b[21Gquestions:\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  · What should a venue's docking fee be based on, and how much? (Today it is a flat 10 credits, paid as a journey to\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bthe venue starts. A furs run makes about 4,600.) → By pad size (Recommended)\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· What should \u001b[21G docked\u001b[29Gship's\u001b[36Ghourly berth f\u001b[51Ge be base\u001b[61G on? D-047 says it includes connected life support. (Today \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bit is 2 credits a simulation hour.) → Pad + occupants (Recommended)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· What happens when a company can't pay its berth arrears? (Today the arrears are taken first each hour and must be\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mfully paid before the ship can leave, so the ship is already held.) → Held, then cargo seized (Recommended)\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B· How should the life support a ship uses in transit (oxygen and cartridge wear) be costed and attributed to a lot?\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m→ At\u001b[11Gits own cost (Recommended)\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;225;139;107mVibing…\u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m55s\u001b[16G· ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m4.4k\u001b[25Gtokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[18C\u001b[6B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
