[0.005, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· What should a docked ship's hourly berth fee be based on? D-047 says it includes connected life support. (Today \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mit is 2 cred\u001b[19Gts\u001b[22Ga simulation hour.) → Pad + occupants (Recommended)\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B· What happens when a company can't pay its berth arrears? (Today the arrears are taken first each hour and must be\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mfully paid before the ship can leave, so the ship is already held.) → Held, then cargo seized (Recommended)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· How should the life support a ship uses in transit (oxygen and cartridge wear) be costed and attributed to a lot?\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m→ At its own\u001b[19Gcos\u001b[23G (Recommended)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;177;185;249m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m ☐ AI operator \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[2m│\u001b[3G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mD-098 says an AI operator sets its venue's fees by a rule. Which rule should W18 use?\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m❯\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m1.\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mOccupancy rule (Recommended)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mOnce a simul\u001b[19Gtion\u001b[24Gday, the AI moves its berth and docking\u001b[64Gfees\u001b[69Gtoward its pads' occupancy: up by 10% when more than\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B3/4 of\u001b[13Gt\u001b[15Ge pads\u001b[22Gare taken, down by 10% when f\u001b[52Gwer\u001b[56Gthan 1/4 are, within\u001b[77G0.5x to 2x of th\u001b[94G authored\u001b[104Gdefaul\u001b[111Gs. \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mArrears\u001b[14Gintere\u001b[21Gt stays \u001b[31G the default.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m2.\u001b[6G\u001b[39mAuthored, fixed\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mEach AI venu\u001b[19G posts the fees author\u001b[42Gd\u001b[44Gf\u001b[46Gr it\u001b[51Gin content an\u001b[65G never chang\u001b[78Gs them. The rule \u001b[96Gs just 'keep the authored\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bones'.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m3.\u001b[6G\u001b[39mUndercut neighbours\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mOnce a day, the AI sets its fees slightly below the lowest posted fee among the venues it knows reports from, \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mbounded below\u001b[20Gby a flo\u001b[29Gr.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m4. Type something.\r\u001b[1B────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  5.\u001b[6GChat\u001b[11Gabout\u001b[17Gthis\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mEnter to select · ↑/↓ to navigate · Esc to cancel\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── jettison-0010 ─\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[12;1H"]
