[0.041, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mAnswered\u001b[12GClaude's\u001b[21Gquestions:\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  · What should a venue's docking fee be based on, and how much? (Today it is a flat 10 credits, paid as a journey to\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mthe venue starts. A furs run makes about 4,600.) → By pad size (Recommended)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· What should a docked ship's hourly berth fee be based on? D-047 says it includes connected life support. (Today \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mit is 2 credits a simulation hour.) → Pad + occupants (Recommended)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[13G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mhappens wh\u001b[25G a company can't\u001b[42Gpay its berth arrears? (Today the\u001b[76Garrears\u001b[84Gare taken first each hour and must\u001b[119Gbe\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bfully paid before\u001b[24Gthe ship can l\u001b[39Gave, so\u001b[47Gthe ship is already held.) → Held, then cargo seized (Recommended)\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1BHow should the lif\u001b[27G support\u001b[36Ga ship\u001b[43Guses in transit (oxygen and cartridge wear) be costed and attributed to a lot?\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B→ At its own cost\u001b[24G(Recommended)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mAnswered Claude's questions:\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[8GD-098 says\u001b[19Gan AI operator sets its\u001b[43Gvenue's\u001b[51Gfees by\u001b[59Ga rul\u001b[65G.\u001b[67GWhich \u001b[74Gule should W18 use? → Occup\u001b[102Gncy r\u001b[108Gl\u001b[110G \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(Recommended)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mYour answers cover dock\u001b[27Gng fees\u001b[35Gby\u001b[38Gpad\u001b[42Gclass,\u001b[49Gberth\u001b[55Gfees\u001b[60Gby\u001b[63Gpad\u001b[67Gclass\u001b[73Gplus\u001b[78Goccupants,\u001b[89Garrears\u001b[97Gthat\u001b[102Ghold\u001b[107Gthe\u001b[111Gship\u001b[116Gand\r\u001b[1B  then seize cargo, transit life support at your cost, and the occupancy rule for AI operators. I'm surveying the\u001b[115Gcode\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthese touch so I\u001b[20Gcan\u001b[24Gdraft\u001b[30Gthe\u001b[34GW18\u001b[38Gplan.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\r\u001b[36C\u001b[2Bthought for 7s)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
