ed,\u001b[97Gnot\u001b[101Gin\u001b[104Gbehaviour.\u001b[115GThe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Greal amounts the\u001b[22G changed those\u001b[37Gthree\u001b[43Gagain,\u001b[54Gthe consol\u001b[65G'\u001b[67G trading \u001b[77Gun\u001b[80Gnow \u001b[85Gnds 90 credits lower: exactly the\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bd\u001b[7Gcki\u001b[11Gg fee's rise.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mChoices I made myself\u001b[25G\u001b[22m(in\u001b[29Gthe\u001b[33Gplan;\u001b[39Geasy\u001b[44Gto\u001b[47Gchange\u001b[54Gbefore\u001b[61Gslices\u001b[68G4\u001b[70Gand\u001b[74G5):\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GA\u001b[7Gfailed\u001b[14Gjourney's\u001b[24Gdocking\u001b[32Gfee\u001b[36Gis\u001b[39Gstill\u001b[45Gnot\u001b[49Grefunded,\u001b[59Gas\u001b[62Gin\u001b[65GW10.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \"What the company paid\"\u001b[29Gmeans the\u001b[39Gl\u001b[42Gt\u001b[44Gpri\u001b[48Ge it paid for oxygen or cartridges.\u001b[84GSupplies\u001b[93Git\u001b[96Gnever\u001b[102Gbought,\u001b[110Glike\u001b[115Ga\u001b[117Gnew\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gship's starti\u001b[19Gg tanks, count as free. I\u001b[45Gchose this to\u001b[60Gvo\u001b[63Gd\u001b[65Gtracking\u001b[74Ga\u001b[76Gcost\u001b[81Gon\u001b[84Gevery\u001b[90Glot\u001b[94Gin\u001b[97Gthe\u001b[101Ghold.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BA trade's\u001b[15Gestimate leaves out\u001b[35Gberth fees, b\u001b[49Gcause a job onl\u001b[65G waits\u001b[72Gdocked when\u001b[84Git's blocked. Life s\u001b[105Gpport \u001b[112Gn tra\u001b[118Gsit\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bis estimated from the engi\u001b[32Ge's cruise\u001b[43Gtime over the distance between\u001b[74Gthe two stations.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
