ocking fee is\u001b[39Gstill not refunde\u001b[57G, as\u001b[62Gin W10.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\"What the company paid\" means the last price i\u001b[52G paid for oxygen or cartridges.\u001b[84GSupplies it nev\u001b[100Gr bought,\u001b[110Glike\u001b[115Ga\u001b[117Gnew\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gship's starting \u001b[22Ganks, count as free. I chose this to av\u001b[62Gid tr\u001b[68Gcking a cost o\u001b[84Gevery \u001b[92Gt in the hold.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GA trade's \u001b[16Gstimate l\u001b[26Gaves out be\u001b[38Gth fees, because a\u001b[57Gjob o\u001b[63Gly\u001b[66Gwaits dock\u001b[77Gd \u001b[80Ghen i\u001b[86G's blocked.\u001b[98GLife\u001b[103Gsupport\u001b[111Gin\u001b[114Gtransit\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gis estim\u001b[14Gted\u001b[18Gfrom the engine's cruis\u001b[42G time over the\u001b[57Gdistance\u001b[66Gbetween the two stations.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GSeized\u001b[12Gcargo\u001b[18Gis\u001b[21Gsold\u001b[26Gthrough\u001b[34Gthe\u001b[38Gowner's\u001b[46Gown\u001b[50Gunload\u001b[57Gand\u001b[61Gsell\u001b[66Gcommands,\u001b[76Gand\u001b[80Gthe\u001b[84Gmoney\u001b[90Gpays\u001b[95Gthe\u001b[99Gdebt\u001b[104Gat\u001b[107Gonce.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BN\u001b[5Gxt is slice\u001b[17G2,\u001b[20Gthe operator's command that\u001b[77Ga \u001b[80Good\u001b[84Gpoint\u001b[90Gto\u001b[93G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/compact\u001b[102G\u001b[39mfirst.\u001b[109GOpus\u001b[114Gat\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
