t \u001b[107Gn a further\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bcommit before you push.\u001b[31GThat keeps history readable,\u001b[60Gand\u001b[64Gsince\u001b[70Gyou push\u001b[79Gyours\u001b[85Glf, nothing\u001b[97Gungated ever leaves the\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bmach\u001b[12Gne.\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mMaking the gate itself shorter\u001b[34G\u001b[22mis\u001b[37Gthe\u001b[41Gother\u001b[47Glever,\u001b[54Gbut\u001b[58Git's\u001b[63Gan\u001b[66Gengine-side\u001b[78Gchange,\u001b[86Gso\u001b[89GI'd\u001b[93Graise\u001b[99Git\u001b[102Gseparately.\u001b[114GBefore\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdoing anything I'd check where\u001b[34Gthe time goes in the gate log. A Manife\u001b[74Gt-only change doesn't n\u001b[98Ged th\u001b[104G rend\u001b[110Grer's smoke\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btests\u001b[11Gd reference frames, whic\u001b[36G the Jetti\u001b[47Gon docs\u001b[55Gpu\u001b[58G at about two thirds of the gate'\u001b[92G time there.\u001b[105GA flag that\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bskip\u001b[9Gthem wh\u001b[17Gn \u001b[20Go engin\u001b[28G code \u001b[36Gang\u001b[40Gd would make Manifes\u001b[62Ggates\u001b[68Gmuch quicker.\u001b[82G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BTell\u001b[8Gme\u001b[11Gwhether\u001b[19Gyou\u001b[23Gprefer\u001b[30Gone\u001b[34Gcommit\u001b[41Gper\u001b[45Gchunk\u001b[51Gor\u001b[54Gkeeping\u001b[62Gper-slice\u001b[72Gcommits.\u001b[81GUntil\u001b[87Gyou\u001b[91Gsay,\u001b[96GI'll\u001b[101Ggo\u001b[104Gon\u001b[107Gwith\u001b[112Gslice\u001b[118G3\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bafter this gate\u001b[19Gand\u001b[23Grun the \u001b[33Gxt gate\u001b[41Gonly o\u001b[78G per chunk).\u001b[91G\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;40H\u001b[?25h"]
