[0.003, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H  smoke tests at all, so my earlier guess was wrong. Two things make it long:\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mThe fixture suite, run under the address sanitiser.\u001b[57G\u001b[22mIt\u001b[60Gtook\u001b[65G144\u001b[69Gs\u001b[71Gand\u001b[75Gfinished\u001b[84G84\u001b[87Gs\u001b[89Gafter\u001b[95Gevery\u001b[101Gother\u001b[107Gsuite.\u001b[114GThe\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bnext\u001b[10Gslowest\u001b[18Gare\u001b[22Gcontent\u001b[30G(60\u001b[34Gs)\u001b[37Gand\u001b[41Gtravel\u001b[48G(31\u001b[52Gs).\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G- \u001b[1mFour separate configure-and-build passes,\u001b[22m one per build varia\u001b[67Gt.\u001b[70G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2BSo a flag for Manifest-only\u001b[32Ghanges\u001b[39Gwould \u001b[46Gav\u001b[49G nothing,\u001b[59Gb\u001b[61Gcause nothing in this gate is engine-only. These would \u001b[118Glp\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Binstead:\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mBatching (no tooling change):\u001b[35G\u001b[22mgate\u001b[40Gtwo\u001b[44Gslices\u001b[51Gat\u001b[54Ga\u001b[56Gtime,\u001b[62Gas\u001b[65GI\u001b[67Gsuggested,\u001b[78Gso\u001b[81Gabout\u001b[87Ghalf\u001b[92Gthe\u001b[96Ggate\u001b[101Gruns.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mSplitting the fixture suite\u001b[33G\u001b[22minto\u001b[38Gparts\u001b[44Gthat\u001b[49Grun\u001b[53Gin\u001b[56Gparallel\u001b[65Gwould\u001b[71Gbring\u001b[77Gthe\u001b[81Gtest\u001b[86Gstage\u001b[92Gcloser\u001b[99Gto\u001b[102Gcontent's\u001b[112G60\u001b[115Gs.\u001b[118GIt\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gwould be a Manif\u001b[23Gt \u001b[26Gest-layout cha\u001b[41Gg\u001b[43G, with no change to what is checked.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BUnt\u001b[7Gl you tell me otherwise, I'll\u001b[37Gtake slice 3 (the AI opera\u001b[64Gors' daily fee rule)\u001b[85Gnext\u001b[90Gand\u001b[94Grun\u001b[98Gits\u001b[102Ggate\u001b[107Gas\u001b[110Ga\u001b[112Gsingle\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcommit,\u001b[11Gthen\u001b[16Ggate\u001b[21Gslices\u001b[28G4\u001b[