[0.530, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;70;70;70m56\u001b[10Gfrom the exact commit's\u001b[34Grun and fetche\u001b[49G log\u001b[54G, separately from local evidence. Tidy\u001b[96Gs last,\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B5\u001b[10Gafter\u001b[16Gev\u001b[19Gry requested\u001b[32Gbuild/test preset, and still fa\u001b[64Gls\u001b[71Gg\u001b[73Gt\u001b[76G(M01, 2026-11-18). Preserve\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B58\u001b[11Gamed-s\u001b[18Gage reporting, and prefer a combined local gate over repeated pushes.        \u001b[96G      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B174\u001b[10G### T10 selected gate an\u001b[35G promotion \u001b[47Golicy   \u001b[56G                 \u001b[74G     \u001b[80G  \u001b[83G              \u001b[98G       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B177\u001b[10Gimpleme\u001b[18Gtation contract.\u001b[35GThe gate order (D-052) is\u001b[61Gimp\u001b[65Gem\u001b[68Gnted in `s\u001b[79Gripts/ci.sh` (M01,\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B18\u001b[10Gclang-\u001b[17Gidy\u001b[21Gin that\u001b[29Gorder for the full gate. Keep `--warnings-as-error\u001b[80G=*` fo\u001b[87G tidy; do\u001b[97Gnot\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B184\u001b[10G`--\u001b[14Gkip-re\u001b[21Gease` omits Release, `--asa\u001b[49G` includes sanitizers\u001b[71Gand `--tidy` includes tidy.       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B18\u001b[10GKe\u001b[13Gp\u001b[15Gordinary f\u001b[26Gilur\u001b[31G propagation: a tidy\u001b[52Gfailure mus\u001b[64G fail the g\u001b[76Gte, after the requested  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B189\u001b[10G`f\u001b[13Gature-base` \u001b[26Gs the\u001b[32Gintegratio\u001b[43G branch. Its push runs the full gate on the resu\u001b[92Gting  \u001b[99G   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B19\u001b[10Gmust verify a successfu\u001b[34G,\u001b[36Gcompleted full gate for tha\u001b[64G exac\u001b[70G SHA unde\u001b[80G th\u001b[84G applicable workflow.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B193\u001b[10GAn ancestor's result, a PR merge candidat\u001b[52G's\u001b[55Gresult, \u001b[64G partial gate, or \u001b[83G mi\u001b[87Gsing, running,\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B197\u001b[10GAvoid the second full gate triggered solely by prom\u001b[62Gting the same SHA to `main`.\u001b[91GRet\u001b[95Gin \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B199:need\u001b[15Gnot\u001b[19Galso\u001b[24Grun\u001b[28Ga\u001b[30Gfull\u001b[35Ggate\u001b[40Gwhen\u001b[45Gthe\u001b[49GPR\u001b[52Galready\u001b[60Gprovides\u001b[69Gthat\u001b[74Gcheck.\u001b[81GThe\u001b[85Gintegrated\u001b[96Gcommit\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   208:administration must be identified explicitly. `script\u001b[64G/tidy.py` needs no warning-policy change.    \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   211:Acceptance evide\u001b[27Gce must include a contro\u001b[52Gled \u001b[57Gidy fail\u001b[66Gre aft\u001b[73Gr\u001b[75Gsuccessful requeste\u001b[95G \u001b[97G    \u001b[102G  \u001b[105G        \u001b[114G    \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   212:build/test stages,\u001b[29Gwith a nonzero gate result and logs\u001b[65Gshowing \u001b[74Ghose stage\u001b[85G ran\u001b[90Gfirst;\u001b[97Ga\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   213:p\u001b[12Gssing full \u001b[24Gat\u001b[27G on the final imp\u001b[45Gementation; and\u001b[61Gpromotion\u001b[71Gchecks\u001b[78Gcovering\u001b[87Gexact-SHA\u001b[97Gsuccess,\r\u001b[1B     215\u001b[10Gdoes not start another full gate, while a new integration commit and an\u001b[82Gexplicit\u001b[91Gmanual\u001b[98Grun\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B18\u001b[10GPreset builds live in `build/clang-debug/`, `build/clang-notui/`, `build/clang-release/`\u001b[99Gand\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B42\u001b[10Gand test \u001b[20Gasks explicitly use the `cl\u001b[75Gfigure\u001b[82Gbefore\u001b[89Gbuild\u001b[95Gand\u001b[49m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[0.345, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;70;70;70m91:`CTEST_PARALLEL_LEVEL` fo\u001b[35G tests\u001b[42Gand `MANIFEST_TIDY_JOBS`\u001b[68Gor tidy on a suitable machi\u001b[96Ge.     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B93:tes\u001b[13G or tid\u001b[22Gwork\u001b[27Grs. CI has it\u001b[41G own explicit\u001b[55Glimits in the workflow.   \u001b[82G            \u001b[95G        \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B33\u001b[10Gverification and ru\u001b[30G Manifest's full gate from a cle\u001b[63Gn checkout using\u001b[80Git\u001b[83G pinned\u001b[91Gfetch\u001b[97Gwith\u001b[102Gno\u001b[105Gsibling-engine\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Boverride. Retain    \u001b[27G    \u001b[32G   \u001b[36G         \u001b[46G      \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B40\u001b[10GA gate is recorded, no\u001b[33G implied. After running it,\u001b[61Gadd a short\u001b[73Ge\u001b[75Gtry to          \u001b[92G     \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B41\u001b[10G[session handoff](session-handoff.md)\u001b[48Gwi\u001b[51Gh th\u001b[56G commit, the pre\u001b[73Gets and suites\u001b[89Ghat passed,\u001b[101Gthe\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B42\u001b[10Gthree state hashes (generation\u001b[42G100-tick, raw price) and the\u001b[71Glog\u001b[75Gpath. Gate logs are ignored\u001b[103Gbuild\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B4\u001b[10Grun is not a gate.   \u001b[32G            \u001b[45G \u001b[47G    \u001b[52G       \u001b[60G    \u001b[65G    \u001b[70G   \u001b[74G     \u001b[80G     \u001b[86G   \u001b[90G         \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B4\u001b[10Gth\u001b[13G \u001b[15Gested tree, full\u001b[32Gcommand, presets, sui\u001b[54Ges, replay hashes and log\u001b[80Gpath. Both tidy findings\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B53\u001b[10GThe CI [workflow](../.github/workflows/ci.yml) runs the full\u001b[71Ggate with\u001b[81G`--tidy` on each push to\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B56\u001b[10Gfrom the exact commit's\u001b[34Grun and fetche\u001b[49G log\u001b[54G, separately from local evidence. Tidy\u001b[96Gs last,\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B5\u001b[10Gafter\u001b[16Gev\u001b[19Gry requested\u001b[32Gbuild/test preset, and still fa\u001b[64Gls\u001b[71Gg\u001b[73Gt\u001b[76G(M01, 2026-11-18). Preserve\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B58\u001b[11Gamed-s\u001b[18Gage reporting, and prefer a combined local gate over repeated pushes.        \u001b[96G      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B174\u001b[10G### T10 selected gate an\u001b[35G promotion \u001b[47Golicy   \u001b[56G                 \u001b[74G     \u001b[80G  \u001b[83G              \u001b[98G       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B177\u001b[10Gimpleme\u001b[18Gtation contract.\u001b[35GThe gate order (D-052) is\u001b[61Gimp\u001b[65Gem\u001b[68Gnted in `s\u001b[79Gripts/ci.sh` (M01,\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B18\u001b[10Gclang-\u001b[17Gidy\u001b[21Gin that\u001b[29Gorder for the full gate. Keep `--warnings-as-error\u001b[80G=*` fo\u001b[87G tidy; do\u001b[97Gnot\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B184\u001b[10G`--\u001b[14Gkip-re\u001b[21Gease` omits Release, `--asa\u001b[49G` includes sanitizers\u001b[71Gand `--tidy` includes tidy.       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B18\u001b[10GKe\u001b[13Gp\u001b[15Gordinary f\u001b[26Gilur\u001b[31G propagation: a tidy\u001b[52Gfailure mus\u001b[64G fail the g\u001b[76Gte, after the requested  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B189\u001b[10G`f\u001b[13Gature-base` \u001b[26Gs the\u001b[32Gintegratio\u001b[43G branch. Its push runs the full gate on the resu\u001b[92Gting  \u001b[99G   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B19\u001b[10Gmust verify a successfu\u001b[34G,\u001b[36Gcompleted f\u001b[75Gunde\u001b[80G th\u001b[84G applicable workflow.\u001b[49m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
