[0.235, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;70;70;70m45\u001b[9Gintegration tests link\u001b[32Gthe\u001b[36Gaggreg\u001b[43Gte\u001b[48Ganifest::Game`. Existing assertions run under th\u001b[97G engine's\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B50\u001b[9G([conten\u001b[18G identity](stage-2-content-plan.md#conten\u001b[60G-iden\u001b[66Gity)). The TUI\u001b[81Gexecutable\u001b[92Gis\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B`build/<preset>/source/tools/tui/manifest_tui`.   \u001b[57G \u001b[59G     \u001b[65G        \u001b[74G     \u001b[80G   \u001b[84G      \u001b[91G     \u001b[97G    \u001b[102G  \u001b[105G              \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B60:workflow. Ru\u001b[23Git\u001b[26Gwithout\u001b[34Ga\u001b[36Gterminal\u001b[45Gusing\u001b[51G`ctest\u001b[58G--preset\u001b[67Gclang-debug\u001b[79G-R\u001b[82G'^console$'`.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B62:optimised build without sanit\u001b[39Gsers and not on CI, fails\u001b[66Gbove half as\u001b[79Gmuch\u001b[84Gagain\u001b[90Gas\u001b[93Gthe\u001b[97Gfigure\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B70:The presets set both to \u001b[35G, so the gate builds that configuration only.\u001b[81G      \u001b[88G    \u001b[93G       \u001b[101G   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B73:proj\u001b[14Gct uses\u001b[23Gead\u001b[27Grs, ke\u001b[34Gping compile commands\u001b[56Gdirectly usable by\u001b[75Gclangd \u001b[83Gnd\u001b[86Gclang-tidy.     \u001b[103G     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B77:smoke tests\u001b[21Grem\u001b[25Gin Jettison's\u001b[39Ggate.\u001b[45GDo\u001b[48Gnot\u001b[52Gconfigure\u001b[62GJettison's\u001b[73Gunsupported\u001b[85Ginstall/export\u001b[100Gpath.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B79:Clang-tidy is opt-in \u001b[31Go\u001b[33Gally (`./scripts/ci.sh --tidy`), since\u001b[72Git is ex\u001b[81Gensive on\u001b[92Ghe \u001b[96G        \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B89:The gate's conservative default \u001b[42Gemain\u001b[48G two compile and test work\u001b[75Grs, and the tidy runner    \u001b[103G  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B91:`CTEST_PARALLEL_LEVEL` fo\u001b[35G tests\u001b[42Gand `MANIFEST_TIDY_JOBS`\u001b[68Gor tidy on a suitable machi\u001b[96Ge.     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B93:tes\u001b[13G or tid\u001b[22Gwork\u001b[27Grs. CI has it\u001b[41G own explicit\u001b[55Glimits in the workflow.   \u001b[82G            \u001b[95G        \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B33\u001b[10Gverification and ru\u001b[30G Manifest's full gate from a cle\u001b[63Gn checkout using\u001b[80Git\u001b[83G pinned\u001b[91Gfetch\u001b[97Gwith\u001b[102Gno\u001b[105Gsibling-engine\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Boverride. Retain    \u001b[27G    \u001b[32G   \u001b[36G         \u001b[46G      \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B40\u001b[10GA gate is recorded, no\u001b[33G implied. After running it,\u001b[61Gadd a short\u001b[73Ge\u001b[75Gtry to          \u001b[92G     \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B41\u001b[10G[session handoff](session-handoff.md)\u001b[48Gwi\u001b[51Gh th\u001b[56G commit, the pre\u001b[73Gets and suites\u001b[89Ghat passed,\u001b[101Gthe\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B42\u001b[10Gthree state hashes (generation\u001b[42G100-tick, raw price) and the\u001b[71Glog\u001b[75Gpath. Gate logs are ignored\u001b[103Gbuild\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B4\u001b[10Grun is not a gate.   \u001b[32G            \u001b[45G \u001b[47G    \u001b[52G       \u001b[60G    \u001b[65G    \u001b[70G   \u001b[74G     \u001b[80G     \u001b[86G   \u001b[90G         \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B4\u001b[10Gth\u001b[13G \u001b[15Gested tree, full\u001b[32Gcommand, presets, sui\u001b[54Ges, replay hashes and log\u001b[80Gpath. Both tidy findings\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B53\u001b[10GThe CI [workflow](../.github/workflow\u001b[75G with\u001b[81G`--tidy` on each push to\u001b[49m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
