[0.821, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;70;70;70m18:the terminal interface\u001b[32Gor\u001b[35Gthe engine's\u001b[48Grenderer,\u001b[58GUI\u001b[61Gand\u001b[65Gdeveloper\u001b[75Gconsole.\u001b[84GThe\u001b[88Ggate\r\u001b[1B     21:CI runs the full gate. `CMAKE_BUILD_PARALLEL_LEVEL`,\u001b[62G`CTEST_PARALLEL_LEVEL`\u001b[85Gand\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B22:`MANIFEST_TIDY_JOBS`\u001b[30Gcontrol\u001b[38Gconcurrency.\u001b[51GClang-format\u001b[64Gmust\u001b[69Gbe\u001b[72Gversion\u001b[80G21.\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   24:A\u001b[11Ggate that pass\u001b[26Gd is not run again \u001b[46Gn the same inputs, as Je\u001b[71Gtis\u001b[75Gn's is: a diges\u001b[91G of the\u001b[99Gworking  \r\u001b[1B     26:clang-format, clang-tidy\u001b[34Gand\u001b[38Gcmake,\u001b[45Gand\u001b[49Gthe\u001b[53Goptions\u001b[61G(the\u001b[66Gpresets\u001b[74Gset\u001b[78Gevery\u001b[84Gbuild\u001b[90Goption\u001b[97Ga\u001b[99Gstage\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B27:reads, so no cached s\u001b[31Gtting\u001b[37Gescapes\u001b[45Gthe\u001b[49Gdigest),\u001b[58Gkept\u001b[63Gunder\u001b[69G`build/gate-passed`\u001b[89Gwhen\u001b[94Git\u001b[97Gis\u001b[100Gthe\u001b[104Gsame\u001b[109Gat\u001b[112Gthe\u001b[116Gend\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bof      \u001b[15G       \u001b[23G        \u001b[32G           \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B29\u001b[9Gpr\u001b[13Get configured with `JETTISON_SOURCE_DIR`\u001b[54Gruns\u001b[59Gevery\u001b[65Gtime\u001b[70Gand\u001b[74Gis\u001b[77Gnever\u001b[83Gkept.\u001b[89G`scripts/tidy.py`\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B30\u001b[9Gskips a unit t\u001b[24Gat \u001b[28Gas clean and\u001b[41Gwhose\u001b[47Gcompile command,\u001b[64Gincludes\u001b[73G(`ninja\u001b[81G-t\u001b[84Gdeps`),\u001b[92Gclang-tidy\u001b[103Gand\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B31\u001b[9G`.clang-tidy\u001b[22G are unchanged since, recorded under `<build>/tidy-clean`.    \u001b[85G    \u001b[90G   \u001b[94G   \u001b[98G   \u001b[102G     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B45\u001b[9Gintegrat\u001b[18Gon tes\u001b[25Gs link\u001b[32Gthe aggre\u001