[0.090, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G2.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mRun the four builds at the same time.\u001b[44G\u001b[22mThey\u001b[49Galready\u001b[57Guse\u001b[61Gseparate\u001b[70Gbuild\u001b[76Gfolders,\u001b[85Gso\u001b[88Gthe\u001b[92Ggate's\u001b[99Gtime\u001b[104Gbecomes\u001b[112Gthe\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bsanitiser build's, about 3.5 minutes. The script would check free m\u001b[74Gmory first\u001b[85Gand fall back to one\u001b[106Gat\u001b[109Ga\u001b[111Gtime\u001b[116Gwhen\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Git's low, for example when your local\u001b[44GAI is \u001b[51Goaded\u001b[57Gand\u001b[61G3.4 GB is free.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mSplit the fixture suite into one test entry per test case,\u001b[22m so its\u001b[72Gcases run \u001b[83Gide by side. The sanitiser tests\u001b[116Gt\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Btake\u001b[11Gabout 60\u001b[20Gto 75 s\u001b[28Ginstead of 144.\u001b[44GWith step 2,\u001b[57Gthe\u001b[61Gwhole gate would\u001b[78Gbe\u001b[81Gabout\u001b[87G2\u001b[89Gto\u001b[92G2.5\u001b[96Gminutes.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4\u001b[6G\u001b[1mClose\u001b[12Ga gap I found:\u001b[22m my local gates haven't been running clang-\u001b[70Gidy at all.\u001b[82GThe flag I passed\u001b[100Gonly sets\u001b[111Ghe numb\u001b[119Gr\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bof tidy jobs;\u001b[20GCI\u001b[23Grun\u001b[28Gtidy, but my gates didn't. I'd add tidy to every gate. It skips\u001b[92Gfiles that were\u001b[108Gclean\u001b[114Gand\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Ghaven't changed, so it costs lit\u001b[39Gle.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mParts of the gate that could be skipped\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[22m- \u001b[1mManifes\u001b[13G:\u001b[22m nothing in its gate is engine-only,\u001b[51Gso\u001b[54Gthe\u001b[58Gskip\u001b[63GI\u001b[65Gsuggested\u001b[75Gearlier\u001b[83Gdoesn't\u001b[91Gapply.\u001b[98GOnly\u001b[103Gtwo\u001b[107Gstages\u001b[114Gare\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bcandidates:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G- The terminal-free build's tests repeat the debug te\u001b[59Gts on\u001b[65Gthe sam\u001b[73G game code.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- The debug\u001b[17Gtests\u001b[23Grepeat\u001b[30Gthe\u001b[34Gsanitiser\u001b[44Gtests.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BOnce th\u001b[13G build\u001b[20G run at \u001b[29Ghe same time, neither\u001b[51Gstage\u001b[57Gis\u001b[60Gthe\u001b[64Gslowest,\u001b[73Gso\u001b[76Gskipping\u001b[85Gthem\u001b[90Gsaves\u001b[96Galmost\u001b[103Gno\u001b[106Gtime.\u001b[112GI'd\u001b[116Gkeep\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bboth.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
