0-minute\u001b[75Grounds\u001b[82Gno\u001b[85Glonger\u001b[92Gblock\u001b[98Gwork.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mRun the four builds at the same time.\u001b[22m They already use separate b\u001b[72Gild fol\u001b[80Gers,\u001b[85Gs\u001b[87G the\u001b[92Ggate's time\u001b[104Gbecomes\u001b[112Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gsanitiser build's, about 3.5 minutes.\u001b[47G script wo\u001b[58Gld\u001b[61Gcheck free memory fi\u001b[83Gt\u001b[85Gand fall back\u001b[100Go one at a tim\u001b[116Gwhen\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bit's low,\u001b[16Gfor example when your local\u001b[44GAI i\u001b[49G loaded an\u001b[61G3.4 GB is fr\u001b[74Ge.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mSplit the fixture suite into one test entry per test case,\u001b[65G\u001b[22mso\u001b[69Gts cases\u001b[78Grun\u001b[82Gside\u001b[87Gby\u001b[90Gside.\u001b[96GThe\u001b[100Gsanitiser\u001b[110Gtests\u001b[116Gthen\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gtake about 60 to 75 s instead of 144. With step 2, the whole ga\u001b[70Ge\u001b[72Gwould\u001b[78Gbe about\u001b[87G2 to 2.5\u001b[96Gminutes.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mClose a gap I found:\u001b[22m my loc\u001b[34Gl\u001b[36Ggates haven\u001b[75Gt all. The flag I passed only\u001b[105Gsets\u001b[110Gthe\u001b[114Gnumber\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
