1b[69Gts cases\u001b[78Grun\u001b[82Gside\u001b[87Gby\u001b[90Gside.\u001b[96GThe\u001b[100Gsanitiser\u001b[110Gtests\u001b[116Gthen\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gtake about 60 to 75 s instead of 144. With step 2, the whole ga\u001b[70Ge\u001b[72Gwould\u001b[78Gbe about\u001b[87G2 to 2.5\u001b[96Gminutes.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B4.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mClose a gap I found:\u001b[22m my loc\u001b[34Gl\u001b[36Ggates haven't b\u001b[52Gen running c\u001b[65Gan\u001b[68G-\u001b[70Gidy at all. The flag I passed only\u001b[105Gsets\u001b[110Gthe\u001b[114Gnumber\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gof tidy jobs; CI runs tidy, but my gates didn't.\u001b[55GI'd add\u001b[63Gtidy to every\u001b[77Ggate. It\u001b[86Gskips file\u001b[97G that wer\u001b[107G clean\u001b[114Gand\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bhaven't\u001b[14Gchanged,\u001b[23Gso it costs little.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mParts of the gate that could be skipped\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mManifest:\u001b[15G\u001b[22mnothing\u001b[23Gin\u001b[26Gits\u001b[30Ggate\u001b[35Gis\u001b[38Gengine-on\u001b[75Gearlier\u001b[83Gdoesn't\u001b[91Gapply.\u001b[98GOnly\u001b[103Gtwo\u001b[107Gstages\u001b[114Gare\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
