[0.064, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mWrite\u001b[22m(~/projects/manifest/build/commit-gate-split.txt)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mWrote \u001b[1m11\u001b[22m lines to \u001b[1m~/projects/manifest/build/commit-gate-split.txt\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 1 \u001b[22mGate: the fixture's two longest cases run beside the rest, tidy in the gate\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 2 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 3 \u001b[22mThe fixture suite took 144 s of the sanitised stage's tests, the gate's critical path, most\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m4 \u001b[22mof it two cases (13 s\u001b[31Gand 7 s of its\u001b[46G25\u001b[49Gs\u001b[51Gin\u001b[54GDebug).\u001b[62GThey\u001b[67Gare\u001b[71Gnow\u001b[75Gthe\u001b[79Gsuites\u001b[86Gfixture_cruise\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m5 \u001b[22mand\u001b[13Gfixture_alone,\u001b[28Gand\u001b[32Gfixture\u001b[40Gis\u001b[43Gevery\u001b[49Gcase\u001b[54Gthey\u001b[59Gdo\u001b[62Gnot\u001b[66Gmatch,\u001b[73Gso\u001b[76Gone\u001b[80Gadded\u001b[86Gor\u001b[89Grenamed\u001b[97Gstill\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m6 \u001b[22mruns; in Debug the thre\u001b[33G take 13 s side by s\u001b[54Gde. A gate on Lythir takes\u001b[81Gclang-tidy, w\u001b[95Gich\u001b[99Glocal\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 7 \u001b[22mgates\u001b[15Ghad\u001b[19Gleft\u001b[24Gto\u001b[27GCI,\u001b[31Gand\u001b[35Gruns\u001b[40Gin\u001b[43Ga\u001b[45Gsecond\u001b[52Gcheckout,\u001b[62Gbuild/gate-tree,\u001b[79Gwhile\u001b[85Gthe\u001b[89Gnext\u001b[94Gchange\u001b[101Gis\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[2m 8 \u001b[22mwritten, with nothing\u001b[31Gelse\u001b[36Gbuilding\u001b[45Gbeside\u001b[52Git\u001b[55G(the\u001b[60Guser's,\u001b[68G2026-11-21).\u001b[81GThe\u001b[85GW18\u001b[89Gplan\u001b[94Ggates\u001b[100Gafter\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 9 \u001b[22mslices\u001b[16G3\u001b[18Gand\u001b[22G5.\r\u0