[0.006, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 83 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 84 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m### Gating beside the work                                                                             \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 85 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m                                                                                                       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 86 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mOn Lythir a commit is gated in a second checkout, so the next change is written while the gate         \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 87 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mruns. `build/gate-tree` is a detached worktree with its own presets' build trees, made once with       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 88 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m`git worktree add --detach build/gate-tree <commit>`; for each commit gated,                           \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 89 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m`git -C build/gate-tree checkout --detach <commit>` and then `build/gate-tree/scripts/ci.sh` with      \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m9\u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mthe \u001b[16Ga\u001b[18Ge's\u001b[22Goptions. While it runs not\u001b[49Ging else builds,\u001b[66Gruns t\u001b[73Gsts or runs\u001b[85Gclang-tidy (the user's,\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m9\u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m2026-11-21), so the work beside it is editing alone. A failure is fixed by a\u001b[88Glater commit, before\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m9\u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mthe push.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 93 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m                                                                                                       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 94 \u001b[22m ## Machine-specific concurrency\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 95 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 96 \u001b[22m [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mD-051\u001b[39m](decision-ledger.md#d-051) distinguishes the laptop's resource limit from other\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe split works, with the longest of three test entries at 13 s against 25 s for the whole suite in debug. I'm\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcommitting, then running the first gate in a second checkout, which will be slow since it builds from scratch.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B· summary\u001b[39m                                   \u001b[76G\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[0.188, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 93 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m                                                                                                       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 94 \u001b[22m ## Machine-specific concurrency\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 95 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 96 \u001b[22m [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mD-051\u001b[39m](decision-ledger.md#d-051) distinguishes the laptop's resource limit from other\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe split works, with the longest of three test entries at 13 s against 25 s for the whole suite in debug. I'm\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bcommitting, then running the first gate in a second checkout, which will be slow since it builds from scratch.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B· summary\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mWrite\u001b[22m(~/proje\u001b[17Gts/manifest/build/commit-gate-split.txt)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mWrote\u001b[12G\u001b[1m11\u001b[15G\u001b[22mlines\u001b[21Gto\u001b[24G\u001b[1m~/projects/manifest/build/commit-gate-split.txt\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[2m1 \u001b[22mGate: the fixture's two longest cases run besid\u001b[57G the rest, tidy in the gate\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 2 \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m   \u001b[2m 3 \u001b[22mThe fixture suite\u001b[27Gtook\u001b[32G144\u001b[36Gs\u001b[38Gof\u001b[41Gthe\u001b[45Gsanitised\u001b[55Gstage's\u001b[63Gtests,\u001b[70Gthe\u001b[74Ggate's\u001b[81Gcritical\u001b[90Gpath,\u001b[96Gmost\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 4 \u001b[22mof\u001b[12Git\u001b[15Gtwo\u001b[19Gcases\u001b[25G(13\u001b[29Gs\u001b[31Gand\u001b[35G7\u0