[0.159, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mWrite\u001b[22m(~/projects/manifest/build/commit-gate-split.txt)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mWrote \u001b[1m11\u001b[22m lines to \u001b[1m~/projects/manifest/build/commit-gate-split.txt\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m     \u001b[2m 1 \u001b[22mGate:\u001b[15Gthe fixture's two longest cases run beside the rest, tidy\u001b[73Gin\u001b[76Gthe\u001b[80Ggate\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m2\u001b[9G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m3\u001b[9G\u001b[22mThe\u001b[13Gfixture\u001b[21Gsuite\u001b[27Gtook\u001b[32G144\u001b[36Gs\u001b[38Gof\u001b[41Gthe\u001b[45Gsanitised\u001b[55Gstage's\u001b[63Gtests,\u001b[70Gthe\u001b[74Ggate's\u001b[81Gcritical\u001b[90Gpath,\u001b[96Gmost\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m4\u001b[9G\u001b[22mof it two ca\u001b[22Ges (13 s and 7 s of its 25 s in Debu\u001b[59G). Th\u001b[65Gy are now th\u001b[78G \u001b[80Guites fixture_crui\u001b[99Ge\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m5\u001b[9G\u001b[22mand fixture_alone, and fixture is every\u001b[49Gcase\u001b[54Gthey do\u001b[62Gnot m\u001b[68Gtch, so one add\u001b[84Gd\u001b[86Gor renamed still\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m6\u001b[9G\u001b[22mruns; in D\u001b[20Gbug the\u001b[28Gthree take 13 s side\u001b[49Gby side. A gate on Lythir tak\u001b[79Gs clang-tidy, which local\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m7\u001b[9G\u001b[22mgates\u001b[15Ghad left\u001b[25Go CI, and runs in a second\u001b[52Gcheckout, build/ga\u001b[71Ge-tree, whi\u001b[83Ge the next change is\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m8\u001b[9G\u001b[22mwritten, with nothing\u001b[31Gelse building\u001b[45Gb\u001b[47Gside\u001b[52Git (the user's, 2026\u001b[73G11-21). Th\u001b[85GW18\u001b[89Gplan\u001b[94Ggates after\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m9\u001b[9G\u001b[22msl\u001b[12Gces 3\u001b[18Gand 5.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m… +2 lines \u001b[18G\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BSearched\u001b[12Gfor\u001b[16G\u001b[1m1\u001b[18G\u001b[22mpattern,\u001b[27Gran\u001b[31G\u001b[1m4\u001b[33G\u001b[22mshell\u001b[39Gcommands\u001b[48G·\u001b[50G\u001b[38;2;255;107;128m1 failed\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe first gat\u001b[17G \u001b[19Gn the second checkou\u001b[40G finished in about 15 minutes, mostly from a cold build, and the sanitiser\u001b[115Gtests\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdropped from 144 s to 79 s. Tidy flagged one existing \u001b[58Gssue at Policy.cpp:673, and I'm checking for oth\u001b[107Grs now\u001b[114G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· summary\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[27C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m9\u001b[40Gthought for 3s)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
