[0.029, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G \u001b[5G \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m  9 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242msettled; its slices are in the plan. Slices 1 (fees by pad class, `9dc5181`) and 2                     \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 10 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m(`Manifest.Company.SetFees`, `ad8f6b3`) are done; next is slice 3, `manifest.pricing`. A commit is     \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 11 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mgated in the second checkout, `build/gate-tree`, with `--tidy`, editing alone beside it                \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 12 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mgating beside the work\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](build-and-gates.md#gating-beside-the-work)). A ship steered in a station's fr\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m    +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mame still runs every step, which is most of the                                                        \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m   \u001b[2m 13 \u001b[22m zero-clien\u001b[23Grun'\u001b[29Gsteps.\u001b[36G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[2m 14 \u001b[22m The plan\u001b[20Ging docum\u001b[30Gnts' home-r\u001b[42Ggion allocation (s\u001b[62Gpe, the roadmap'\u001b[79G regio\u001b[86G supply and D-076) waits\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[2m 15 \u001b[11G\u001b[22mfor W13 \u001b[20Go restat\u001b[29G it as founding.\u001b[46G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mWrite\u001b[22m(~/projects/manifest/build/commit-handoff.txt)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mWrote \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m lines to \u001b[1m~/projects/manifest/build/commit-handoff.txt\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[2m 1 \u001b[22mDocs:\u001b[15Gthe\u001b[19Ghandoff\u001b[27Gat\u001b[30GW18's\u001b[36Gslice\u001b[42G3,\u001b[45Gand\u001b[49Gthe\u001b[53Ggate\u001b[5